abstract: >-
  AGQ combines action sensitivity and a measured weight-recovery cost proxy
  for matrix-wise bit allocation, per-channel calibration, grouped lossless
  coding, and block-wise recovery in vision-language-action models.
keywords:
  - vision-language-action
  - quantization
  - mixed precision
  - robotics
  - model compression
